&lt;p data-start=&quot;154&quot; data-end=&quot;458&quot;&gt;FC Mobile 2026 is the latest version of EA SPORTS&#039; football game for mobile devices, offering improved graphics, smoother gameplay, and updated player rosters. With new events, live challenges, and real-time PvP matches, players can build their Ultimate Team&trade; using top stars from clubs around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;460&quot; data-end=&quot;480&quot;&gt;🔥 &lt;strong data-start=&quot;463&quot; data-end=&quot;479&quot;&gt;Key Features&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;481&quot; data-end=&quot;518&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;483&quot; data-end=&quot;518&quot;&gt;Real-time 1v1 multiplayer matches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;519&quot; data-end=&quot;556&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;521&quot; data-end=&quot;556&quot;&gt;Career Mode &amp; new seasonal events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;557&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;559&quot; data-end=&quot;588&quot;&gt;Legendary players and ICONs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;589&quot; data-end=&quot;622&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;591&quot; data-end=&quot;622&quot;&gt;Custom tactics and formations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;623&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;625&quot; data-end=&quot;657&quot;&gt;Enhanced player control and AI&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;659&quot; data-end=&quot;829&quot;&gt;💎 &lt;strong data-start=&quot;662&quot; data-end=&quot;706&quot;&gt;How to Get Free Points in FC Mobile 2025&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;br&gt;EA Points are used to unlock premium packs, special events, and upgrades. Here are a few ways to earn or get free points:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol data-start=&quot;830&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;830&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;904&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;833&quot; data-end=&quot;856&quot;&gt;Daily Login Rewards&lt;/strong&gt; &ndash; Get free points just by logging in every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;905&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;908&quot; data-end=&quot;989&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;908&quot; data-end=&quot;932&quot;&gt;Season Pass &amp; Events&lt;/strong&gt; &ndash; Participate in special events and complete objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1058&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;993&quot; data-end=&quot;1058&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;993&quot; data-end=&quot;1006&quot;&gt;Watch Ads&lt;/strong&gt; &ndash; Earn small point rewards by watching in-game ads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1059&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1062&quot; data-end=&quot;1146&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1062&quot; data-end=&quot;1084&quot;&gt;Promos &amp; Giveaways&lt;/strong&gt; &ndash; Look out for EA&#039;s official giveaways and community rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1147&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1150&quot; data-end=&quot;1274&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1150&quot; data-end=&quot;1170&quot;&gt;Third-Party Apps&lt;/strong&gt; &ndash; Use trusted apps that offer gift cards for completing surveys or tasks (like Google Opinion Rewards).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
